    "d102 say: The joints throb; everything costs more than it should. (-1 HP)",
    "d102 say: — NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.",
    "d102 say: Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should.",
    "d102 say: Riders from The Red Table: something's at THEIR door now. They can't spare anyone — and they wanted Haven to know first.",
